        <div class="export-card"><h4>📊 CSV DYNAMICS</h4><p>Time-series per-node dynamics — position, force, current, power vs time.</p><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.emff.exportCSV()">EXPORT CSV</button></div>
        <div class="export-card"><h4>🛰 GMAT SCRIPT</h4><p>GMAT formation script — multi-body propagator with EM force model for W5 integration.</p><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.emff.exportGMAT()">EXPORT GMAT</button></div>
        <div class="export-card"><h4>📄 TXT MANIFEST</h4><p>Mission manifest — formation config, EM parameters, stability analysis, power budget.</p><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.emff.exportTXT()">EXPORT TXT</button></div>
        <div class="export-card"><h4>🖼 PNG SNAPSHOT</h4><p>Export current 3D formation view as high-resolution PNG.</p><button class="btn btn-teal btn-sm" onclick="window.emff.exportPNG()">EXPORT PNG</button></div>
        <div class="export-card"><h4>📋 YAML CONFIG</h4><p>YAML formation configuration for pipeline integration and reproducibility.</p><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="window.emff.exportYAML()">EXPORT YAML</button></div>
      </div>
